Privacy Policy

Effective Date: May 9, 2026

Capture All the Stars does not collect, store, share, or sell any personal information.

The app does not require an account, does not use analytics, does not track users, and does not include third-party advertising.

Game activity, such as moves, hints, difficulty choices, sound settings, and puzzle progress, is used only within the app experience. Any saved settings remain on the user’s device.

If this policy changes in the future, the updated version will be made available with the app listing or within the app.

